<title>USA: Target gets GDC System cleared in Japan.</title>
<headline>Target gets GDC System cleared in Japan.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif. 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Target Therapeutics said it received final clearance to market its GDC System in Japan.</p>
<p>The GDC System is designed for minimally invasive treatment of patients with intracranial aneurysms that are othwise considered either inoperable or very high risk for surgery.</p>
</text>
